<description>&lt;p&gt;UNIFIL patrols were again hit by fire in southern Lebanon while Israeli forces expanded road networks, opened new bases, and conducted airstrikes on Qantara and overflights across southern Lebanon and Beirut, injuring a Lebanese footballer and detaining a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah arrested five members in Batroun, continued artillery fire on Israeli positions, and began cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was killed in Beirut and his death prompted further updates. France opened a probe into alleged Israeli war crimes and protests against Israeli attacks occurred in Sweden. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdzVILXVQb1pXa053QmhuN0NQSjRRcEZRMjV1dGZBTXp3VWRSOG1wMlFnTjlfaFVxN0dqTllrUjhmbUs3MEY1ZktaZE9EUUg1cHQ0Z0ZwMDFyUHc4S1REdTRYUzR4bDJrbnFfQnRzZlRxR2txRUJXSGlhYlBTdG5JeGlIUlk5WEd4bDBWcy1mVzNlaGVyT1dtVVFTNjJ3NDk1SVNHSXkzVXBHN3BNMU1QWnJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE00dnAybThMdHhUZFB5UkEyZE85UVdqbFlkX3R5WEZrR2lkOGxTMEZRZHZLZmNOdlZXTG1WazQyS29CaEdyQ3JxY1FpOXM3UWV0WG85RG55UDJJQUNBRVlQY0haT0UzWXd1eldfODh4Sk1MSXA1N1JLVm5iVkwxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPREY2aVJXSzMtakpWQlBVeWxoTk5XbmF0eTdTSEVfNVIzbHZzZ1pQTVlHak12VzBSUTE4MF9ETzhkMlNJUzIydTdKd3g0emtBRHVkMnNJb3p5ck5wbTdITTA1aWJxN3dCeE8tdjc2dE55a0FNZ05XMURnSFNNcEE4Ty1ROVVmdTg2bklTZkt2U01mbGRzN0FNbDR4UVVWd3R4NUJ3djAwbG1BSlc0NmxCRmRPcGVtVXJ1aFdGbHV0Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;L'Orient Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https